# Python toolsets

- `@unreal.uclass()` class inheriting `unreal.ToolsetDefinition`.
- Tools: `@toolset_registry.tool_call` then `@staticmethod`, with Python type annotations.
- Register in `init_unreal.py` via `toolset_registry.registration.Registration`.
- Raise on failure. Do not return error strings.
- Docstrings are the MCP schema. Do not restate types.
- Read-only tools stay read-only. No save, spawn, delete, or property writes in `AnastasisInspectTools`.
